title: metarecord-list:open
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Metarecord list: open the selection in the other panel

Shows the row under the cursor of the [[metarecord-list panel]] in the other slot — the `file` panel when the metarecord has a file, [[metarecord-detail panel]] otherwise ([[Cross-panel selection]]).
